// The base everyone is built on (pipeline/pixel/README.md, "Characters"): a 16 x 24 frame, the feet on the bottom row,
// the head 12 pixels wide. Facing down, up and left (right is left mirrored by the game), each standing and in two
// steps. Skin is drawn in the skin slot (a b c), so any skin tone is a swap; shoes are the fixed brown (o).
// Outfits, hair and hats are drawn over this in the same frame.

sprite body/base 16 24

frame down
................
................
.....######.....
...##aaaaaa##...
..#aaaaaaaaaa#..
