..#bbaaaaaabb#..
..#b#aaaaaa#b#..
...##bbbbbb##...
....#bb##bb#....
....#bb##bb#....
....#oo##oo#....
.....##..##.....

frame down.step_a from down at 0 20 replace
....#bb##bb#....
....#bb##oo#....
....#oo#.##.....
.....##.........

frame down.step_b from down at 0 20 replace
....#bb##bb#....
....#oo##bb#....
.....##.#oo#....
.........##.....

